Microsoft (R) VC++ Technology Improvement Program Uploader Version 14.51.36257.0
Copyright (C) Microsoft Corporation. All rights reserved.

Usage: VCTIP [options]

Options:
  -upload:[optout|optin|skip]    Permanently opt-out/opt-in to uploading or temporarily skip uploading
  -unstable:[mark|clear|info]    Mark, clear, or get information on stability of VCTIP
  -timeout:<seconds>             Specify server timeout in seconds (0 = disable timeout)
  -sendDiscreteEvents            Send individual component events along side aggregated events
  -agglimit:<num>                Specify maximum parallel aggregation keys
  -aggtimeout:<seconds>          Specify aggregation timeout in seconds
  -trace                         Output trace information during upload
